  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_HEADER.webp\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=9033af&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"My projects\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"My projects\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER1.webp\" alt=\"Overview\"></p>\n<h3><strong>Biomes O Plenty 兼容性數據包</strong></h3>\n<p>此數據包旨在增強 Moog's End Structures 與 <strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 的整合。安裝此數據包後，我們現有結構的風格將自動切換為使用 Biomes O Plenty 中的更多方塊，從而在使用兩個模組時創造更協調且身臨其境的體驗。</p>\n<h3><strong>使用方法</strong></h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>下載：</strong>下載兼容性數據包</li>\n<li><strong>安裝：</strong>將整個資料夾放置到您的世界資料夾中的 <code>datapacks</code> 目錄下。</li>\n<li><strong>重新載入：</strong>執行指令 <code>/datapack enable \"file/moogs_end_structures_bop_compat\"</code> 或 <code>/reload</code> 以套用變更。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3><strong>重要注意事項</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>此數據包需要同時安裝 <strong>Moog's End Structures</strong> 和 <strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 才能正常運作。</li>\n<li>此數據包所做的具體結構變更僅在安裝後生成的新區塊中可見。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>DISCORD</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER3.webp\" alt=\"DISCORD\"></p>\n<p>獲得回覆的最佳且最快方式是加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmesbop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_PROMO.webp\" alt=\"BHsponser\"></a></p>",
